{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_title", "source_sha256": "48db75ca8e0ebf857f82219e683ec893975e7ac8492bebeccde6b30cabf8316e", "ja": "相応しき者", "zh": "适任者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_synopsis", "source_sha256": "573e483ba9a4849888a5664223f36cb1c571c0e462bb062cf438008318a5d43b", "ja": "次回センターの座を賭け、瑞希とジュリアの\n勝負が始まる。貴音が考えた謎のお題に、\n木の葉のごとく翻弄されるふたり。瑞希の\n熱意に助けられ、最後の課題をクリアした\nジュリアは言った。「勝者はミズキだ」―。", "zh": "为了争夺下次Center的宝座，瑞希与茱莉亚\n展开对决，两人却被贵音出的诡异题目玩弄于\n股掌之上。茱莉亚在瑞希的热情相助之下，\n通过了最后的题目，但茱莉亚却说出──\n「是瑞希赢了。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "ac195e69b612631f53c471ddeb9ff491b86cf87a061a3e03699565c0a11734b9", "ja": "それでは、これから私とジュリアさんとで\nセンターを賭けた勝負を行います。……負けないぞ。", "zh": "那么，就来开始我与茱莉亚争夺Center宝座的比赛。\n……我不会输喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5a97ab226e6baca1b4d2916c949e0ac83d9f58879f33763e84d2de8e7c9b413d", "ja": "2人の勝負にしては、\nギャラリーが多い気がするんだけど……。", "zh": "为什么只有你们两个要比赛，\n却跑来这么多观众啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "adb83838d87b2617c02ab29c0b0231699a1c6941bfbc6ce520819b4a3045302d", "ja": "私たちも、当日一緒にステージに立つということで\n瑞希ちゃんに呼ばれたんです。", "zh": "因为我们当天也会一起上台表演，\n所以瑞希就找我们过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3804cfcb66ea855e93834b93f01447b0d3d1ae62a7ea9377a96bcae281e6221", "ja": "審査員として、参加して欲しいって。\nまさか、センターをかけた勝負だったなんて……。", "zh": "她希望我们能担任评审。\n没想到她们要为了Center的位置比赛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "a6b2f1096109faefb7c76aecb13f613aa9505c07e8eebda6e7d15787c35f8453", "ja": "瑞希さん、じゅ、ジュリアさん……\n大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "瑞希、茱、茱莉亚……\n她们不要紧吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bccdc57779db7027704e1e25160568374c395e219601841dc6add1ffeff96ce1", "ja": "なるほど。\nで、貴音は……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n那么，贵音是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "1114e55e278677f39a55215e320023a94faafebeac0aca1eae87114760a817c4", "ja": "はい。私は先日、あの場にいたこともあり……\n勝負の立ち合いをするよう、頼まれたのです。", "zh": "是这样的，由于小女子之前正好在场……\n于是便被她们请来担任比赛的见证人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "f3806c11b3fb617db4050741f1086500e918048379126e281e83cb7f02c95a24", "ja": "四条さんは、先輩ですし。アイドルに相応しい\n対決の課題も、考えていただけたらと思いまして。", "zh": "毕竟四条姊是前辈。\n于是我想到请她来出适合偶像的对决题目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c2aed352aa52eaa47000584115f1401be262d045d8baf64d99dfece2214e83df", "ja": "アイドルに相応しい課題か……\n大丈夫そうか？　貴音。", "zh": "适合偶像的对决题目啊……\n你处理得来吗，贵音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "f10686b1dfe1ed315f22f38e71570eb0354ac2de65c906a3a636d0ea4bf1738f", "ja": "はい、おまかせください。私なりに、課題を\n考えて参りました。ふたりとも、準備はいいですか？", "zh": "可以的，请交给小女子吧。\n小女子已经出好题目了，请问两位都准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "88ff4c167a97e4db51d525ddad4503474ebcd6105760f1f2923406a9e82a6575", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だ、ヒメ。\n……やるからには本気で行くぜ、ミズキ。", "zh": "好了，我没问题，公主。\n……既然要比，我就会来真的喔，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "9277103aa8ae4a1529de20fdd33c30f9310c58c0167e79ea29bb89f4fc731528", "ja": "はい、もちろんです。\n勝負ですから、全力でお願いします。", "zh": "好的，那是当然。\n毕竟是比赛，请你拿出全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "dffaa3a016a2e71accc58e9c089877ed93f37a8b02981b3d9f3d426f7c34b079", "ja": "へぇ……ずいぶん自信があるんだな。\nってコトは、勝算があるのか？", "zh": "哦……看来你很有自信嘛。\n所以，你觉得自己有胜算吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "8268bb7638a1c48704a6370afdd5bfe5912411475cf26cbe031bcbc0c268fb46", "ja": "いいえ。あまりないので……\nけど、今から作ります。", "zh": "不。其实我没什么胜算……\n但是，接下来就会创造出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "27c6a3719d6011db90c2fe673fd71f0e13b94b7e675f28203606518a35bd0c2c", "ja": "ははっ♪　ミズキのそういうトコ、\n嫌いじゃないぜ。", "zh": "哈哈♪\n瑞希这样的个性，我不讨厌喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "0890ec0236741604bdb76aaa33938ba3a9199d7fd238d6d603340bb71c52e894", "ja": "さあ、ヒメ。\nセンター対決のテーマはなんだ！？", "zh": "好啦，公主。\nCenter对决的主题到底是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "6318a3b38da95e83d06c9b71532342ebea0b49d05abcffd89e0e8c1cf6fc2da1", "ja": "センターが持つべき素養……。\nそれを表すのは、まず『落語』です。", "zh": "Center该具备的素养……\n能够展现素养的题目，首先从『落语』开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "72d911c4ccf2219c7ea976a31f6336fb32311bc5527e090200116e6869b7399e", "ja": "ら……落語！？　落語って、あの落語だよな？\nそれ、アイドルと関係あるのか！？", "zh": "落……落语！？你说的落语，是那个落语吗？\n那跟偶像有什么关系啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "4d59e9819597eb27171369738b3a154ea202c971ca57cf2f7f9779bf2d7aa5dd", "ja": "はい。伝統的な話芸を会得し、観客を笑わせる力は\n舞台の中央に立つには必要不可欠なものかと。", "zh": "是这样的，小女子认为要立于舞台中央，\n必须学会传统的说唱艺术，取得为观众带来欢笑的能力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f9ae8bea76499ca7c90f2954e90f7e20e5b6d2643d623a9547486c7f3fb8883d", "ja": "わかるような、わからないような……。", "zh": "我感觉似懂非懂啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "600eb23faa5055940a2cc9503fa6c24e1824866af3213177de2eaf473f703716", "ja": "お題に、短めのものを用意しました。\nふたりとも、かんぺ、はこちらです。", "zh": "小女子已经准备好简短的落语主题。\n请两位领取讲稿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "bab196370c3058937e55a200317a037c400addeb4552f7c7c018cc30bb095e59", "ja": "四条さんがそうおっしゃるなら、私は挑戦します。\n寿限無、寿限無……。", "zh": "既然四条姊都这么说了，我愿意挑战。\n寿限无、寿限无……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "0af4c65f22f323fc44383eb870e029b0570302a6255811ce086890248b7c9217", "ja": "くっ……やる気だな、ミズキ。\nなら、あたしも負けてられないぜ！", "zh": "唔……看来你是认真的，瑞希。\n好吧，那我也不能退缩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "d7aed15e7a4356d59280302379cce3b6d30d7d86e85000fa310b196287e2db9b", "ja": "お後が、よろしいようで。\n……小咄、披露させていただきました。ぶい。", "zh": "那么，下台一鞠躬。\n……以上给看官带来笑话一则，耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "a7a968de2da1c1b0f5e5e0f988085a35a396ebcb4c9d8befb02e75dd4ecc86e2", "ja": "すごい、瑞希ちゃん……！\n今の小咄、ちゃんとオチがついてて面白かった……！", "zh": "瑞希好厉害喔……！\n刚才的笑话，结尾很精彩，非常有趣呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "e7bf3a64f91cdd9cbdf54f8eb25f9ff08b883ce4385435f2b5698c566d6574aa", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……\nカレン、あたしはどうだった！？", "zh": "呼、呼……\n可怜，我讲得怎样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "5f10e2ca742c60f055fc3b4ab129a1b73813f8968ee8fabe65a697192f2e7ee2", "ja": "じゅ……ジュリアさんも……、\n個性を生かした語り口が、素敵でした……！", "zh": "茱……茱莉亚也是……\n说唱中有发挥你的特性，非常精彩……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "01c6a3f1a3c46ba733bf461bd95675211f16efd90a5894c1eaaee83399c5563c", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさまでした。\nでは、次の勝負に参りましょう。", "zh": "辛苦两位了。\n那么，继续下一场对决吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "b44a9b7f0afe330b54fd9e95036b34fbcfaf32ef491ee41985c8e18557012cb6", "ja": "ええっ！？　ま、まだあるのかよ！？", "zh": "什么！？还、还有吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "bf42424549e87d8abe738b4c0fe2fcad06a931cf89a6e4c3b99eeb6855889446", "ja": "なんと……。", "zh": "竟然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "439cd08a6b7a726888595b6685173f31573baded5f64a05a6fe80b6cfbb3a36e", "ja": "もちろんです。アイドルとして大成するためには、\n話術だけ出来ればいい……というわけではありません。", "zh": "那是当然，只凭嘴上功夫\n就想成就偶像大业……那是不可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "933a968f65534c18f9ba3cf10b6b02faaca0b5901a479a86b1e3b9b8c0742e61", "ja": "ぐっ……たしかに、そうだな。\nよし、ヒメ！　次のテーマをくれ！", "zh": "呜……有道理，你说得对。\n好，公主！快出下一道题目吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "42a855a2d648505b5280e1d00a9698ee329eb49c92bf4507c8d09abc4f8c633c", "ja": "もちろん、私にも。\n……かもん。", "zh": "不用多说，我也同意。\n……来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4dfee7b9c997baebff546f2363580552ef3fbd08e40a406d33533389525245eb", "ja": "（瑞希達は、次々と貴音の繰り出す謎……いや、\nアイドルとしての課題をこなしていった。そして……）", "zh": "（瑞希她们接二连三地达成贵音提出的诡异……\n不是，是身为偶像该面对的题目。然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "5a63dbb05241a1178cb2aade97ef01ab8fafc1843a0fbd11c0ce4caf08c5b113", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\nジェスチャー、なかなか難しいです……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n比手画脚，还挺困难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa797fe4c3154198914df12ff380ae81ce2041021a7f33e1701c2e39945eb3c3", "ja": "くっ……さっきのタンバリン対決のダメージが、\nやっとマシになってきた……まだまだいけるぜ！", "zh": "呜……刚才在铃鼓对决落后太多，\n总算是追回来了……我还能继续比！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1036_p", "source_sha256": "223627c406acd84918b9202e4ba3b812490211982cba96da104c64915da43587", "ja": "ここまで見てる限り、\nふたりの勝負は互角だな……。", "zh": "就目前来看，\n她们俩平分秋色呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "7ab907e2977fec668f0e5d7b2a87d165c9537dffa34ddac6a5b1d3c603e01f14", "ja": "瑞希さん……ジュリアさんも、すこし休んだほうが……\nふ、ふたりとも、だいぶ辛そうです……。", "zh": "瑞希……茱莉亚，还是先休息一下吧……\n你、你们俩看起来都筋疲力尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc5c22c3e875dadb0071e78689b1b4141dc36d7933306a3fb254a7ce7101cb99", "ja": "いえ、これくらい大丈夫です。\nセンターを目指すなら、全力で勝負しなくては。", "zh": "不，这点程度没问题的。\n为了成为Center，必须全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "edd268384dcea43109e22d8e51da32582931b88666eccb3617d5a9d9847c8147", "ja": "瑞希ちゃん……。", "zh": "瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc53628c93986a8c3255126a5f1b38a9ebb9b94699cb18a19177c7fad7524331", "ja": "私は、センターに憧れています。そのための努力を、\n自分なりにしてきたつもりでした……これまで。", "zh": "我一直很向往担任Center。\n为此，我自认付出了许多努力……直到现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "82d8e2892693ca638cdfb5cf79f4f39c86319e2ae31150edcf1dcaf15d8a7bcc", "ja": "ミズキ……。", "zh": "瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "a0099241b798340dc860a85d4defb7280e40601ba146b8883e95d06dde1db941", "ja": "しかし、{$P$}は私とジュリアさんの\nどちらを今回のセンターにするか、迷っていました。", "zh": "但是，{$P$}却犹豫了，\n不知道这次的Center该交给我还是茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "e03ee89e802f3935c30a86bdc9b7dc0175b0d718f2761b4a6731ce2da0620fe6", "ja": "私の気持ちが、伝えきれてなかった。\nだからこそ……この勝負、負けられません。", "zh": "这表示我的决心没有彻底传达出去。\n所以……这场比赛，我更加不能输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "6779c58de1ab9f076f54c2eb92b13b35481dc5584faeafa48e2917c648aab421", "ja": "瑞希。あなたの気持ちは、皆に届いてますよ。\n私にも、{$P$}にも。", "zh": "瑞希，你的决心，各位都感受到了。\n无论是小女子，还是{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "acf3bc77208ec5cf855458ca470df3073a48871a83e15fb18e6d5d0bed7024a3", "ja": "……ああ！　まだ勝負の途中だけど、ミズキの本気は\nあたしにも痛いくらい伝わってきてるぜ！", "zh": "……是啊！虽然比赛还没结束，\n但我已经深刻感受到瑞希多么认真了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "39ec63dd9441384984f63e87d77f1d53d842597b28ac18b5095b0cdbbbe4db48", "ja": "……ありがとうございます、四条さん。\nジュリアさんも。", "zh": "……谢谢你，四条姊。\n还要谢谢茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1047_044miz", "source_sha256": "28d1f41cbe93f012b087d1b7f83291cb2f1872ca303aacf73d37798f76b0b3e6", "ja": "では……引き続き、\n正々堂々、本気の勝負をお願いします。", "zh": "那么……我们继续，\n堂堂正正、全力以赴一较高下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "dd7c6c7c68266f3d804de9da714f774d9851c5b017b82b70404ddd923b76fde1", "ja": "ああ。望むところだ！", "zh": "好，求之不得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1049_008tak", "source_sha256": "58e8541b207a45d13f29c6bdc6b64e124823a312ac9283f20c0a7f381043acf9", "ja": "それでは、最後の勝負といたしましょう。\n最後は……『重い物持ち上げ対決』です。", "zh": "那么，就进入最后决赛吧。\n最后是……『抬重物对决』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "39bc097bb0414bb61d2c76ab462620789a05975ec71445658c7adde2afb96be0", "ja": "劇場の中で、一番重いと思われる物を\nこちらに持ってきました。", "zh": "小女子将剧场里\n最重的物品搬来这里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1051_p", "source_sha256": "3a079589c9edf894348759cee85bf4d87855494766bd2c2af1c30d61e3daa3e6", "ja": "こ、これはサンドバッグ！？\nいったいどこにあったんだ……。", "zh": "这、这不是沙包吗！？\n本来放在什么地方啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "58ede083e01df6d192203c99dad39d88b9592a706cfb8f17412e15780471c8aa", "ja": "うっ……な、なんだこれ！？\n相当重いぞ……。", "zh": "呜……不、不会吧！？\n这很重喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1053_008tak", "source_sha256": "f1008e0aee4c5a0a3aaee959015a0638ebf2eaf15ee28665eb437fa55dae210d", "ja": "こちらを持ち上げて、\nできるだけ遠くに投げた方を勝者としましょう。", "zh": "能把这个沙包抬起来，\n并且丢得最远的一方获胜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1054_044miz", "source_sha256": "78d9133d07eaec0dab25f09a6f11fa8f02b5c6c5af501915571a691fa7d8bfff", "ja": "なんと……。この重量感。\nひとりでは、とても無理そうです。しかし……。", "zh": "什么……？依这个重量，\n一个人不可能办得到，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "4b81925f9d91488ee3ecd5a4cb12a413f44ea67d4b120fdc5421b7078d9598bf", "ja": "ああ。これが最後の課題だから、後のコトは\n考えなくていいってわけだ。ミズキ、全力で行くぜ！", "zh": "没错，这是最后一道题目，没有后顾之忧了。\n瑞希，全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1056_p", "source_sha256": "dcb7db33fe642e4a5f37d6c275ff0668ffa3d4cde7cbba53dd30198a8553cdf7", "ja": "いや、後のことは考えなくていいわけじゃないぞ！\nふたりとも、聞いてるかー！", "zh": "等一下，什么叫没有后顾之忧！\n你们两个，有听到吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1057_017kth", "source_sha256": "ae7fc5158b5d9098de67c72f044c6bd14c5d9c267933002fcf1bc5ed29df729d", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nふたりともセンターっていうのはダメなんですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n就不能让她们俩同时担任Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1058_045kar", "source_sha256": "3f762c5657aeeadec10404e18ac3babd24a8e22276a7f4b5660db3a23de7d15d", "ja": "わ、私も……瑞希さんとジュリアさん、\nどちらも、センターに相応しいと思います……。", "zh": "我、我也觉得……瑞希和茱莉亚，\n她们两位都很适合担任Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1059_p", "source_sha256": "6e50ddb45a0c195666930547387dd4fe928e41ac16132f46bc692ba733714e46", "ja": "確かに、琴葉と可憐の言うことはもっともだと思う。\nけど……。", "zh": "琴叶、可怜，你们说得确实没错。\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1062_p", "source_sha256": "178d2761640b2d98d2dbb43ff6ddea996e8e67dc172a824228af4be1d6642648", "ja": "ふたりとも、センターになるために真剣なんだ。\nそれを引き分けにする方が、不誠実かなって。", "zh": "她们俩都是很认真想要成为Center的。\n随便就判她们平手，反而有欠公平。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1063_017kth", "source_sha256": "e69229cbba61a5383751425004327b8b9679183a58e6b3c3a29751423e32b2fc", "ja": "そう……ですね。\n{$P$}の言うとおりでした。", "zh": "这么说……也是。\n{$P$}说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1064_045kar", "source_sha256": "66fe906939e678aa0bb0069901bdb61616a24b5e576319ba0522d3ae564bc4c1", "ja": "わ、私……ふたりのこと、お、応援します……！\nふたりとも……がんばって……！", "zh": "我、我……要帮她们两位加、加油……！\n你们俩……要加油啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1065_050jul", "source_sha256": "2d06a6eea3be9f6301ff7c2ec2b8017644d97dc6d3dabca641286b1c4cedbbe7", "ja": "くっ……！　あたしとしたコトが、自分で思ってたより\n疲れてたみたいだ。これじゃ、持ち上げるのも……。", "zh": "呜……！失算，没想到我已经这么累了。\n这样子，根本就抬不起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1066_044miz", "source_sha256": "5f940f109b6de29ca45371586847a2d4397781dfe1fab433ec8763ba3c8df376", "ja": "いえ、まだまだです。まだいけます、ジュリアさん。\nあきらめずに、がんばりましょう。", "zh": "不，还没结束。你还可以的，茱莉亚。\n不要放弃，继续努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1067_050jul", "source_sha256": "94f187101830c4f30376fdb1c2f277194b2ea0b01e24756908d87a0a0c9cc568", "ja": "ミズキ！？　なんで……。\nこのままいけば、おまえの勝ちなんだぞ。", "zh": "瑞希！？为什么……\n不要管我，你就赢啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1068_044miz", "source_sha256": "17fd78d9524545b297e7b10bccf1ab9ff3b254b576a235a59302a0548bd85581", "ja": "はい。でも、ここまで来ましたから。\n一緒にクリアしましょう。", "zh": "是的，可是我们都已经坚持到这里了。\n不如就一起过关吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1069_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a065188cd9993421b5eb2de25a6fe64f26ed1867ae9464053fdf0d963057588", "ja": "瑞希ちゃん、ジュリアちゃん……\n私も、ふたりを手伝います！", "zh": "瑞希、茱莉亚……\n我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1070_045kar", "source_sha256": "4edf78d70cbf355fd7ab07ac84053789b295e8dcd788cb99d888033cc7809a72", "ja": "わ……私も……！　み、みんなで、力を合わせて……\n貴音さんの課題を、クリアしましょう……！", "zh": "我……我也一起……！大、大家同心协力……\n通过贵音的题目吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1071_050jul", "source_sha256": "83990874c6817e94f5c29f278f33b958d22c67fbb6603ab8517a0e9817bcc351", "ja": "ミズキ……琴葉、カレン……。ああ、そうだな！\n全員でクリアするぞ！　……せーの！", "zh": "瑞希……琴叶、可怜……对啊，你们说得没错！\n大家一起过关吧！预备──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1072_se", "source_sha256": "e051129ec2f11c2b4f2efb7d59f46a880970eaf1df06c7dcc986a74d49c6688f", "ja": "どすーん！", "zh": "咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1073_008tak", "source_sha256": "296f5286a1094c62b65f43ccb44c6f1d731e13f1ef225e5d28cf226f26fc6f42", "ja": "皆、お疲れさまでした。\n素晴らしい戦いを見せていただきました。", "zh": "各位辛苦了。\n你们展现了一场精彩的战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1074_p", "source_sha256": "63b0e3ca09c80bb122c6aa84815afa01c226031fce2ed7412fffeeeca5d4f80c", "ja": "結局、勝負は引き分けだったな。\nそれじゃ、センターは……。", "zh": "结果，比赛平手了。\n这样的话，Center该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1075_050jul", "source_sha256": "a2c6aed698b50c82da21c3e6a3e8e696b74d56118be2c56c1365434d2ca7a25f", "ja": "……いや。\nこの勝負、勝者はミズキだ。", "zh": "……不。\n这场比赛，是瑞希赢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1076_044miz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1077_050jul", "source_sha256": "568a8a833faaf00c15490039d714ce4db42d57d3f585cbf528f612e479b94460", "ja": "この勝負、あたしは一度、あきらめようとした……。", "zh": "我在最后一度想放弃比赛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1078_050jul", "source_sha256": "5fc34fad679ec6bf6f44224167de4149ad2ea288263a9c5b26955cb5ea2a9f84", "ja": "けどミズキが『あきらめるな』って言ったから、\n最後のヒメの課題をクリアできたんだ。そうだろ？", "zh": "但瑞希要我别放弃，所以我们才能通过\n公主的最后一道题目，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1079_044miz", "source_sha256": "0b75335daf20b73ff6c8b2252f4296349a09b87739e6153dfe6832b67ce3a68a", "ja": "ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1080_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c9b2811ee9f0ade903e3e6c29a6d1206c34208f7bf8679c9e933fdf7b1ef694", "ja": "なあ、{$P$}。\n{$P$}も、それで文句ないだろ？", "zh": "我说{$P$}。\n{$P$}，你也没意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1081_p", "source_sha256": "0ac8b8a6f5fcf58d8ba77bf3a2b3654c1e164510213414b253787067bde65849", "ja": "ああ。もちろんだ！", "zh": "没有，我当然没意见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1082_008tak", "source_sha256": "5a6d29ad02619573033a5ec1e78d2a2715aaf69084ed642f47237c2020fb78ca", "ja": "瑞希、おめでとうございます。あなたなら、公演の\n中央に立つに相応しい振る舞いが出来るでしょう。", "zh": "瑞希，恭喜你。想必你一定能拿出\n配得上公演中央位置的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1083_017kth", "source_sha256": "6415295eb6f3479bf6085f6396b47b95aa2e513231aac7c9267e77273cfcee11", "ja": "おめでとう、瑞希ちゃん。\n次の公演、私も精いっぱい努めるから。よろしくね！", "zh": "恭喜你，瑞希。\n我也会努力准备下次公演的，请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1084_045kar", "source_sha256": "6b696a8e59fed33a88f683fa947fa0f77191b03747094d80de71b4c565f2b167", "ja": "お、おめでとうございます、瑞希さん……\nジュリアさんも……素晴らしい勝負でした……グスッ。", "zh": "真、真的很恭喜你，瑞希……\n茱莉亚也是……这是场很棒的比赛……（啜泣）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1085_044miz", "source_sha256": "98b05bf64fc02fba74032a6074289d19e712cb7eb7e274b1c4bf94a503034bc0", "ja": "四条さん……ありがとうございます。\n田中さん、篠宮さん。そして、ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "四条姊……谢谢你。\n也谢谢田中姊、筿宫、还有茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1086_050jul", "source_sha256": "2750c100f48a1b84527cfa656d4650a69b264d0a0e25c90ab9a49eb07cbdd1a0", "ja": "ああ。\n最高のセンターを期待してるぜ、ミズキ！", "zh": "不客气。\n我很期待你成为最棒的Center喔，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1087_044miz", "source_sha256": "da1a6c8b8e07fa9f9553405958db5475e01e11449c192fd7a533d143984e9728", "ja": "はい。必ず、みんなの期待に応えてみせます。\n……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "好的，我一定不会辜负大家的期待。\n……要上啰，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_025_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_025_1088_p", "source_sha256": "69c97432f61a087b1aaa429c0c3654a1d08ce4ae7dee83a780bca11e00c227b8", "ja": "（瑞希の熱意は、ジュリアだけでなく他のみんなにも\n火を着けた……。これは、本番が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（瑞希的热情不只点燃了茱莉亚，\n也点燃了其他人……看来正式演出值得期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
